y from enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >does not notice you until you are in the field of view, you can run away, hiding around the corners and changing rooms. This evil is beyond your power, you will not be able to kill it, survive and find a way out - this is the only solution.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229530/extras/4417679aa0e1428ee534d79ebf0936bd.poster.avif?t=1763328912\" width=948 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229530/extras/4417679aa0e1428ee534d79ebf0936bd.webm?t=1763328912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229530/extras/4417679aa0e1428ee534d79ebf0936bd.mp4?t=1763328912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229530/extras/5930c49c7491c50b7778b8694df990af.poster.avif?t=1763328912\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229530/extras/5930c49c7491c50b7778b8694df990af.webm?t=1763328912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>You will witness one of fate's jokes, played out on one of its random harlequins — Nora, an ordinary girl around 25 years old.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road, the headlights, the screech of wheels, the impact. After the accident, you are in need of help. The doors of one of the houses were open, as if inviting you inside. But along with them, the curtain of the performance had already risen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Details: